In the Lab, we’re always tinkering 🧪– from the experiments we graduate to the ones still brewing, we bring the best of our AI models to all kinds of users. Try out these two (if you haven't already!):

@PomellibyGoogle - build captivating marketing campaigns tailored to your brand and your business at scale

@FlowbyGoogle - craft visual stories that channel your imagination and draw the attention of your audience

Bio: Google’s home for our latest AI tools and experiments.
❤️ 110  🔁 10

One of the things we think about a lot @spc is that as investors we must deeply embody the traits we look for in founders.
@evantana doesn't like to talk about himself...but it is one of the great joys (and privileges) of my life to work with someone as driven, talented and curious as him to build SPC for many years and decades to come.
Bio: General Partner @SPC, Co-Founder @Bevel_Health | Ex: Early Eng @facebook, CTO @Dropbox, Board @Flipkart | Optimist, Builder, Dad ❤️ 78 🔁 2
